  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Baron's Otherworldly Citadel</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Vital Strike</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> Once per round, before you make an attack of opportunity, you can declare an opportunistic vital strike. If the attack hits, you can apply the effects of your Vital Strike feat. You can apply the Improved Vital Strike or Greater Vital Strike feat instead if you have either of those feats. If you confirm a critical hit with an opportunistic vital strike, you can attempt a single combat maneuver against the target as a free action—this combat maneuver does not provoke an attack of opportunity.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/practitioner-feats#toc76\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
